  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The Council hereby certifies that the operations described above would be lawful within the meaning of section 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended), as the use of one room within the three bedroom property for booking management, email/phone communication, and storage of records for a private hire vehicle office would be incidental to the main use of the property as a dwelling house (Use Class C3). ",
    "Condition : 2 - INFORMATIVE: You are advised that no vehicles associated with the use should come to the property and there should be no access to the property for customers. "
  ],
